{
  "_comment": [
    "Measured similarity scores for the A-22 calibration run (#124, D-022).",
    "",
    "Scores only. No vectors, no raw model output, and no endpoint: this file is",
    "the evidence a threshold derivation is reproducible from, and it lives in a",
    "public repo. The questions themselves are in similarity_pairs.json; this",
    "file references them by name and never restates them.",
    "",
    "The run FAILED the committed criteria and therefore seeded no calibration",
    "entry. The file exists so that failure is executable rather than a claim in",
    "a document -- see calibration_measured_test.go, which re-derives the",
    "threshold from these numbers and asserts the derivation still fails.",
    "",
    "Regenerate with:",
    "  FORGE_LIVE_ENDPOINT=<endpoint> go run ./cmd/calibrate nomic-embed-text",
    "Scores are bit-reproducible: two runs in separate processes returned",
    "identical values, and the model returns bit-identical vectors for repeated",
    "input."
  ],
